Companies must provide information on policies, implementation, and outcomes or explain the absence of such policies (“comply or explain”). The proposals also align reporting standards with international frameworks such as the UN Global Compact and OECD Guidelines.', 'Sweden', 'climate', 'in_force', '2014-01-01'::date, 'Sweden', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/171_4', ARRAY['sdg4', 'sdg13', 'other sustainability policy', 'sdg7', 'mandatory', 'sdg5', 'sdg16', 'mandatory_regulations', 'sdg12', 'sweden']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('048a2cf6-d0ed-5cd6-b209-83a34f501424', 'Sweden Swedish Code of Corporate Governance', 'The Swedish Code of Corporate Governance, 2010', 'This code does not make mention of disclosure requirement, it simply outlines structure of good corporate governance, although it mentions the directive in one line, it makes no other reference to non-financial information (other than gender balance for the board).', 'This code does not make mention of disclosure requirement, it simply outlines structure of good corporate governance, although it mentions the directive in one line, it makes no other reference to non-financial information (other than gender balance for the board).', 'This code does not make mention of disclosure requirement, it simply outlines structure of good corporate governance, although it mentions the directive in one line, it makes no other reference to non-financial information (other than gender balance for the board).', 'Sweden', 'social', 'in_force', '2010-01-01'::date, 'Sweden', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/171_12', ARRAY['other sustainability policy', 'regulations', 'mandatory', 'sdg5', 'sdg16', 'sweden']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
